# 🛡️ Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework for Cybersecurity Education Using Generative AI

An AI-powered cybersecurity education platform that enables students and beginners to learn ethical hacking concepts through interactive simulations, AI-assisted guidance, network scanning, and packet analysis in a safe and controlled environment.

---

# 📖 Project Overview

The **Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework** is an educational platform that combines **Generative AI** with cybersecurity tools to provide practical learning experiences. The application integrates **Google Gemini**, **Nmap**, and **Wireshark** into an interactive **Streamlit** dashboard.

Users can:
- Generate AI-based cybersecurity scenarios
- Learn ethical hacking concepts with an AI mentor
- Perform network scanning using Nmap
- Analyze captured network packets using Wireshark
- View parsed scan results and reports through a user-friendly dashboard

This project is developed for educational purposes to help students gain hands-on cybersecurity knowledge.

