# 🚀 Installation

## Step 1: Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Devika246617/Ethical-Hacking-Simulation-Framework.git
```

## Step 2: Navigate to the Project Directory

```bash
cd Ethical-Hacking-Simulation-Framework
```

## Step 3: Install Required Python Packages

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Step 4: Run the Application

```bash
streamlit run dashboard.py
```

## Step 5: Open the Dashboard

After running the above command, Streamlit will display a local URL similar to:

```
http://localhost:8501
```

Open this URL in your web browser to access the application.

